sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Agent
  participant N as NLB
  participant W as OPW
  participant D as Datadog
  participant S as S3
  A->>N: send logs (TLS)
  N->>W: forward :8282
  activate W
  W->>W: scan + redact
  par two copies
    W->>D: redacted
  and
    W->>S: raw (PutObject)
  end
  deactivate W
  Note over W,S: raw copy never leaves GovCloud
